<div class="join-container mx-auto mt-2">
  <div class="join-text">
    <h1 class="text-center"><%= @campaign.title %></h1>
    <% if @already_joined %>
      <p>Thou hast already assumed thy place amongst our bretheren.</p>
    <% else %>
      <p>
        By the gods’ solemn decree, thou art summoned on a fateful journey.
        Fortune and glory await beyond an arduous journey paved with uncertainty,
        danger, and peril at the hands of your somewhat questionable decisions.
        Thy fate shall entwine with wanderers of all walks of life.
        Bringeth they friendship or folly remain shrouded in mystery as you take
        your first step on a new adventure. Wilt thou heed the call?
      </p>
      <%= button_to add_player_path(@campaign),
    method: :post,
    class: "sign-here-button",
    data: {
      controller: "invite-link",
      action: "click->invite-link#sign"
    } do %>
        <%= image_tag "sign-here.png",
      class: "sign-here",
      data: { invite_link_target: "sign" } %>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
